ID:          7
Service:     service-a
Severity:    P1
Opened:      2026-05-29 16:36:12
Resolved:    2026-05-29 16:36:24
Title:       service-a silent mutations: /time returns empty body + health hardcoded degraded
Report:      Two uncommitted mutations in service-a caused the upstream pipeline failure. (1) services/service-a/src/routes/time.ts line 8 changed from res.json(response) to res.json({}) — service-b received an empty body on every poll, parsed undefined as the UTC field, and new Date(undefined) threw "RangeError: Invalid time value" on every poll tick, driving service-b's consecutiveFailures counter up. (2) services/service-a/src/app.ts line 9 hardcoded health response to { status: "degraded" }. Health poller showed service-a as ok at 16:27:38 (last recorded check predated the mutation taking effect) — the broken /time route was a silent poison to the pipeline rather than a visible health failure.
Fix:         Restored res.json(response) in services/service-a/src/routes/time.ts line 8. Restored { status: "ok" } in services/service-a/src/app.ts line 9.
QA:          Covered by existing service-a test suite (2/2 pass). No new tests required — existing GET /time and GET /health tests validate both fixes.
